  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_a416dc60-4aac-40cf-bb45-83824937b99d.png\" alt=\"模組包標題：Alon in a Raft - 於無盡海洋中求生\" width=\"850\" height=\"445\"></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>專為在無盡海洋中求生而設計的獨木舟模組包</strong></h1>\n<h1><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_c9fc0688-1562-45b1-9b72-48acd09bae1f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></strong></h1>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_0663d6d7-c36f-4ccd-bcaf-55fb431b282a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></h3>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_e031080c-a2c2-4216-8341-5fef05c836ca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/haubna/collections\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>-&gt; 新增物理模組 Pro 以獲得真實波浪效果 -&gt;</strong></a></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_aaf0b279-4149-41c6-b353-7e2b4b46f8fc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></strong></span></p>\n<h3>世界生成與結構</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>海洋：</strong>世界生成已透過 <em>Ocean World</em>、<em>Deeper Oceans</em> 和 <em>Tectonic</em> 進行修改，以打造以深水地形為主的世界。</li>\n<li><strong>敵對實體：</strong>大型海軍威脅包括災厄村民戰艦、軍艦、維京長船和三列槳戰船。</li>\n<li><strong>探索：</strong>透過 <em>Aquamirae</em>、<em>YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments</em> 和 <em>Underwater Village</em> 擴充了水下內容。</li>\n<li><strong>初始條件：</strong>初始重生點已透過 <em>Raft world spawn</em> 鎖定為獨木舟結構。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_23738f4f-8363-4f59-98fc-7cf6e042964d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\">\n<h2><strong>生存與環境</strong></h2>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>飲食系統：</strong>以 <em>Farmer's Delight</em> 為基礎，並透過 <em>Ocean's Delight</em>、<em>Tide's Delight</em> 和 <em>Aquamirae Delight</em> 進行擴充，提供以海洋為主的進度系統。</li>\n<li><strong>大氣系統：</strong><em>Weather, Storms &amp; Tornadoes</em> 引入了影響航行的嚴重氣象事件。</li>\n<li><strong>海洋生物：</strong><em>Alex's Mobs</em>、<em>Aquaculture 2</em> 和 <em>Fish of Thieves</em> 增加了水生動物的密度與多樣性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_6079b7fb-727c-43d1-92ec-a233d5fe984c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223093/description_ce725e62-5d55-4605-bf53-20e7911d7c5f.png\" alt=\"「Alon in a Raft - 在無盡海洋中求生」模組包的贊助商\" width=\"850\" height=\"170\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">如果您想支持我，可以透過此連結開立 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>WABBANODE</strong>&nbsp;</span></a></span>伺服器，使用代碼 <strong>TRUYTY</strong> 可享 25% 折扣</span></h3>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">多人一起生存會更容易！</span></strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_99dd4369-7e84-427a-ac44-7f362bb5d794.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></p>\n<p>🔻 想要加入更多&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">水域</span></strong>細節嗎？&nbsp;</p>\n<div><hr><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NuQV3ZkVxR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1168668/description_9227c40d-ce36-4b21-bf38-0ed69b1f8337.gif\" width=\"803\" height=\"103\"></a></div>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">如果您是內容創作者，您將獲得專屬稱號！</span></h4>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>如果您喜歡這個模組包，我推薦其他作品！</strong></h2>\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/spellnomia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1145/853/638711902228707430.png\" alt=\"Spellnomia 模組包\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/apocalypssia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1302/26/638846418762745282.png\" alt=\"Apocalypssia 模組包\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/dungeonia-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1305578/changelog/changelog_67961805-1699-435f-9ffb-cdbe584cc909.png\" alt=\"Dungeonia 模組包\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\"></a></h5>\n<hr>\n<h1>立即下載獨木舟模組包！</h1>",
